# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# Credentials never live in the repo. See README: they go in ~/.ideagen.env.
.ideagen.env
*.env

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- accounts
# Who can log in, and the scrypt hash of their password. This repository is
# public: committing this file would publish the roster of everyone with access
# plus material to attack offline. It was untracked but NOT ignored, which is
# the worst of the three states — one `git add -A` away from being permanent.
data/accounts.json
data/accounts.json.tmp
# The one-time password notebook `scripts/seed_accounts.py --passwords` writes,
# so both nodes can be seeded with one set of credentials. Plaintext by nature.
*.passwords.json
data/seed_passwords.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- generated
data/ideagen.db
data/ideagen.db-*
data/logs/
web/index.html
web/report.json

# ---------------------------------------------------- third-party content
# This repository is public. The briefing pack embeds verbatim excerpts from
# Wisburg's subscription research, and the Olive snapshots contain Nexus HK
# product-shelf data (product codes, NAVs, yields). Neither is ours to
# republish, so both stay local. Both are regenerable:
#     python -m ideagen.cli ingest && python -m ideagen.cli score
#     python -m ideagen.cli brief
#     python -m ideagen.cli olive-ingest <your own capture>
data/briefings/
data/snapshots/

# Local analysis material and partner dumps — not ours to republish, and this
# repo is public. Kept local only; excluded so `git add -A` cannot leak them.
olive-dump/
discr_acct_bt*/
discr_acct_bt*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
.venv/
venv/

# Platform artifacts — run products live in TOS, not in git
data/artifacts/
data/exports/

# cloud resource inventory (account ids, EIPs, resource ids) — operator-local
data/cloud_inventory.md
web/_site/

# ask 问答审计日志（含问题原文，operator-local）
data/ask_log.jsonl
# PM 准则卡账本：他自己的话 + 本机运行状态，跟 ask_log 同一性质。
# 它是复现一次运行的一部分，所以归审计包带走，不归仓库。
data/philosophy/
